  "contract": [
    "Open the file and compare exact typed metadata fields against RFC 9559 element values and defaults.",
    "Fold optional Info title, MuxingApp and WritingApp, then edition UID and flags, recursive chapters with times and flags, and each display title and effective languages.",
    "Fold all tag Targets, their type and per-kind UID lists, and nested SimpleTags with name, language, default, text and binary values. Fold attachment UID, data, filename, MIME and optional description."
  ],
